{"4620980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Nights of the Sleeping God", "steam_appid": 4620980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You did not come here to return, did you?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into a classic roguelike where nothing is scripted - chemistry, physics, and anatomy are simulated. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge weapons from flesh and bone, cast magic you must learn yourself, eat your enemies, die and try again - all on your way to godhood. The paid cost will never be enough! 100 floors of madness, blood, grievance and monsters, that await you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4620980/extras/a35e9f1d3b1052752374f39d2919612b.avif?t=1780174081\" width=960 height=400 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Highly Moddable:</strong> Everything can be changed as you see it fit - from AI behaviors to chemistry elements. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully Simulated:</strong> Combat unfolds through physics, gases spread through the air, armor dents and weapons shatter, a well-placed blow can stop a heart cold - or start again. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bring your own gameplay:</strong> Create your weapon from bones and gold, cast magic that will stop hearts (even yours), or destroy everything with chemistry - there's no intended way to play! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Persistence: </strong>The dungeon does not reset when you die. Your corpses, spilled blood, and slain enemies will stay. And they will never leave.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You did not come here to return, did you?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into a classic roguelike where 